---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service | AVARHQ" 
  description="Terms of service and usage guidelines for the AVARHQ digital mirror.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 space-y-12 text-gray-400">
    <header class="border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter text-white mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Last Updated: Current</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 prose prose-invert prose-cyan max-w-none">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">1. Age Restriction</h2>
        <p>Utmost care is taken to curate the contents of this website. However, by accessing or using AVARHQ, you verify that you are at least 18 years of age. If you are under the age of 18, you must leave this website immediately.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">2. Nature of the Service</h2>
        <p>AVARHQ acts strictly as an informational mirror and expanded database for our Instagram page. The service is provided "as is," completely free of charge, with no registration required and no advertisements displayed.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">3. Copyright & Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The contents of this website are not our copyright. All credits, intellectual property rights, and ownership of the displayed anime, manga, promotional artwork, and characters belong exclusively to the original studios, manga artists, and involved creators.</p>
        <p>Our display of this data via public APIs (AniList, Jikan) constitutes fair use for informational, review, and archival purposes. If you are a copyright holder and believe your work has been used outside the bounds of fair use, please contact us via our official Instagram channel for immediate removal.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">4. External Links</h2>
        <p>We provide dynamic links to official, legal streaming platforms (e.g., Netflix, Crunchyroll) retrieved via API. AVARHQ is not responsible for the content, subscription models, or privacy practices of these external platforms.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>